      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "HARA'S NERO (8) goes very well at the course and distance with three wins and a placing from five starts. Comes off a (21.62) win last time, scoring by 4.5 lengths in a Grade 5 over 380m at this track. Rates on top and should go close. WHITE CAR (7) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 6th at this track following on from a second place finish (21.85) there the start prior. Has a good record here at this journey. Can figure in the finish. SWING SHIFT (4) was out of the placings last time when seventh at this track (22.54) but scored five back at this track (21.82). Should be in this for a long way. FEDERAL GALAXY (6) profiles nicely over this trip.",
